ein (GAP) for GNA12 and GNA13, and as guanine nucleotide exchange factor (GEF) for RhoA GTPase. Activated G alpha 13/GNA13 stimulates the RhoGEF activity through interaction with the RGS-like domain. This GEF activity is inhibited by binding to activated GNA12. Mediates angiotensin-2-induced RhoA activation."},{"po":105516,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"1.685283","d":"double"},{"po":105516,"n":"display name","v":"ARHGEF1"},{"po":105516,"n":"tissue::adrenal gland","v":"2.130155","d":"double"},{"po":105516,"n":"tissue::gall bladder","v":"1.463395","d":"double"},{"po":105516,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":""},{"po":105516,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"2.942127","d":"double"},{"po":105516,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000337261"},{"po":105516,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"3.392637","d":"double"},{"po":105516,"n":"tissue::spleen","v":"2.853805","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"padj","v":"8.160134826915054E-13","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"stringdb::namespace","v":"stringdb"},{"po":105507,"n":"compartment::golgi apparatus","v":"2.610122","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"tissue::urine","v":"4.539046","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"compartment::nucleus","v":"3.672209","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"stringdb::structures","v":["1e8b_A","1fnh_A","1j8k_A","1o9a_A","1oww_A","1qo6_A","1ttg_A","2ec3_A","2fn2_A","2gee_A","2h45_A","2ha1_A","2n1k_A","2rkz_E","3m7p_A","3mql_A","3t1w_A","4lxo_A","5dft_A","5j6z_A","5j6z_B","5m0a_A","5n47_D","5n48_B","6hnf_A","6mfa_A","6msv_I","6xax_B","7nwl_C","AF-P02751"],"d":"list_of_string"},{"po":105507,"n":"tissue::saliva","v":"2.728921","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"stringdb::species","v":"Homo sapiens"},{"po":105507,"n":"compartment::peroxisome","v":"2.183416","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"tissue::liver","v":"4.97566","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"lfcSE","v":"0.3381173537924915","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"compartment::extracellular","v":"5.0","d":"double"},{"po":105507,"n":"tissue::stomach","v":"4.329056","d":"double